[b][Balance][/b]
-Slightly reduce the move speed of Geisha (not disguised state) ;
-Reduce the recovery rate of Energy Charges of Geisha (disguised state);
-Cancel the location tip (the red spot) when Extractor use Energy Charges who is into digital form;
-All of Watchers' attack power is reduced by 7%. Now if an Extractor can be chased long enough, the Extractor can bear 1 more normal attack before the Extractor is knocked down first time (because energy shield will recover gradually).
--------------------------------
[b][Map][/b]
-Changed the appearances of Data Miner and Data Warehouse, now you can find these machines easier and know how many Data Cubes in them directly;
-Fixed some bug spots of HANGING GARDENS maps.
--------------------------------
[b][Rank system][/b]
-Now Extractor's rank points will be calculated personally. If an Extractor have a good performance in a match, will get more rank points to rank up. We will continue to observe how the new rank point system works and possibly make continuous adjustments.
--------------------------------
[b][New contents][/b]
-Added some new simple game guides to new players, you can read the guides when you start to matchmaking;
-Added Player Referral System:
      ● Each player will have a unique referral code. Use another player's referral code, will get 2000 cash (coins), this reward only can be got once;
      ● Once the invited player's game account reach lv.15, it means the inviter invite this player successfully. The more invitation, the more rewards:
          1. Invite 1 player successfully to get 2000 cash (coins);
          2. Invite 2 player successfully to get 20 Classic Supply Chips;
          3.Invite 3 player successfully to get the special skin: Warden-No.1 (as shown below);
      ● Player Referral System is permanent.

Hi, if you have some opinions for the game ,please join in our Discord channel and discuss with devs or other players: [url=https://discord.gg/SbtYM3x]https://discord.gg/SbtYM3x[/url]

[b][Balance][/b]
-The skill value "Crow's Requiem" was a calculation mistake, which result in the issue of skill power, now its power is decreased by 30%;
-Skill "Everyone is a hero" was low power in matches. Originally, it's a good skill for solo Extractor player, so now it is changed to "After being attacked by the Watcher, get 3 Energy Charges (from 2 Energy Charges)";
-The same issue with above, the power of skill "Self-Protection Spray Paint Can" is increased by 40%.
-We realized that "implanted virus randomly in machines when Extractors enter the Arena" is not a good update, now we have removed it.
